# Important Viva Questions

## What is jQuery Mobile?

jQuery Mobile is a touch-optimized framework used to create responsive mobile web applications.

---

## What are advantages of jQuery Mobile?

* Responsive design
* Cross-platform support
* Easy UI development
* Touch-friendly components

---

## What is data-role in jQuery Mobile?

`data-role` defines UI components like page, header, footer and button.

Example:

```html
<div data-role="page">
```

---

## What is ListView?

ListView displays mobile-friendly lists.

---

## What is responsive web design?

Responsive design automatically adjusts layout according to screen size.

---

## Difference between Website and Mobile Website?

| Website          | Mobile Website   |
| ---------------- | ---------------- |
| Desktop oriented | Mobile optimized |
| Large layout     | Touch friendly   |
| Fixed width      | Responsive       |

